## Counterbalanced performance

The final production/evidence/guard source commit is frozen before artifact
construction, as required. Immutable A and B artifact hashes, the idle
preflight, two discarded warmups per artifact, all six `AB/BA/AB/BA/AB/BA`
pairs, ordinary medians, median paired ratio, maximum RSS, and the dual gate
decision are appended after that one authorized measurement. No source,
tool, build, facade, or guard mutation is permitted between the source freeze
and timing.
